# Phase 4C — Shell Hook 方案

把下面这段加到 `~/.hermes/config.yaml` 末尾：

```yaml
# ═══════ Phase 4C: mem0 inject-context (pre_llm_call) ═══════
hooks:
  pre_llm_call:
    - command: "~/.hermes/agent-hooks/mem0-inject.sh"
      timeout: 5

hooks_auto_accept: true
```

启用前请先读 `integrations/INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md`。
